---
import HomeLayout from '../layouts/HomeLayout.astro';
---

<HomeLayout>
	<main>
		<section>
			<h1>Art MD</h1>
			<p>
				Art MD is an extensible Markdown language for structured data. It
				expresses structured data in Markdown with a language specification and
				JavaScript libraries, enabling human and machine authoring at scale and
				automated transformations. This site demos Art MD features and hosts its
				documentation.
			</p>
		</section>
		<section>
			<h2>Learn more</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="/about">About Art MD</a> — what the project is and what this site
					hosts.
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="https://github.com/noodlestan/art-md">Art MD on GitHub</a> — the
					source repository.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section>
			<h2>Demos</h2>
			<p>Code, design, and interaction demos are coming soon.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</HomeLayout>